{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_18_HY_002", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0006"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0006_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "When Mavis Stephens\nbecame pregnant with\nher first child in 1995,\nshe expected a healthy pregnancy.\nShe was young and active and had no\nreason to think otherwise.", "semantic_text": "When Mavis Stephens became pregnant with her first child in 1995, she expected a healthy pregnancy. She was young and active and had no reason to think otherwise.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0006_geometry", "bbox": [68, 774, 422, 943], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0006"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_25/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0018/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_18_HY_003", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0007", "D0008", "D0009"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0007_F001", "D0008_F001", "D0009_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "But during her fifth month of\npregnancy, Mavis noticed some\nswelling and water\nretention. She\nmentioned it to\nher doctor, who\nadvised her to rest more, keep her\nfeet elevated, and reduce her salt\nintake. Swelling and water retention\nare common in pregnancy, the\ndoctor said.", "semantic_text": "But during her fifth month of pregnancy, Mavis noticed some\nswelling and water retention. She mentioned it to her doctor, who\nadvised her to rest more, keep her feet elevated, and reduce her salt intake. Swelling and water retention are common in pregnancy, the doctor said.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0007_geometry", "bbox": [103, 947, 373, 996], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0007"}, {"member_id": "D0008_geometry", "bbox": [239, 997, 403, 1095], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0008"}, {"member_id": "D0009_geometry", "bbox": [103, 1096, 411, 1219], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0009"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_25/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0018/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_18_HY_004", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0010"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0010_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "PERSONAL\nSTORY", "semantic_text": "PERSONAL STORY", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0010_geometry", "bbox": [97, 1024, 219, 1074], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0010"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_25/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0018/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_18_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0011", "D0012"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0011_F001", "D0012_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "At the beginning of her third\ntrimester, her swelling got worse.\nAfter taking her blood pressure at\na prenatal visit, her doctor sent\nher to the hospital. Mavis was\ndiagnosed with preeclampsia, a\ndangerous pregnancy complication\nthat includes high blood pressure\nand signs of damage to another\norgan system, usually the liver and\nkidneys. She would need to stay at\nthe hospital until she delivered, her\ndoctors said.", "semantic_text": "At the beginning of her third trimester, her swelling got worse. After taking her blood pressure at a prenatal visit, her doctor sent her to the hospital. Mavis was diagnosed with preeclampsia, a dangerous pregnancy complication that includes high blood pressure and signs of damage to another organ system, usually the liver and kidneys. She would need to stay at\nthe hospital until she delivered, her doctors said.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0011_geometry", "bbox": [104, 1220, 405, 1495], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0011"}, {"member_id": "D0012_geometry", "bbox": [465, 794, 771, 844], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0012"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_25/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0018/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_18_HY_006", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0013"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0013_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "One week later, Mavis started\nleaking amniotic fluid and was\ntransferred to a hospital that\nwas better equipped to deliver a\npremature baby. Doctors discovered\nthat Mavis had HELLP syndrome—a\nserious complication of high blood\npressure during pregnancy. They\nrushed Mavis into the operating\nroom for an emergency cesarean\nsection. Her son was born at 28\nweeks, and two days later, he died.", "semantic_text": "One week later, Mavis started leaking amniotic fluid and was transferred to a hospital that was better equipped to deliver a premature baby. Doctors discovered that Mavis had HELLP syndrome—a serious complication of high blood pressure during pregnancy. They rushed Mavis into the operating room for an emergency cesarean section. Her son was born at 28 weeks, and two days later, he died.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0013_geometry", "bbox": [465, 847, 779, 1145], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0013"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_25/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0018/decisions.json"}
